      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Feh...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004600650068002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It won’t even sniff at any of the food I offer it.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd when I took it to the Pokémon Center, they\nweren’t sure what might be wrong with it...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah! You know, I recall there was once an herbalist\nwho had set up shop around here in Lumiose...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHe no longer runs that old store, but perhaps he’d\nhave something that could help!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 187
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll stay by this little one’s side for now. Please go\nsee if you can find the old herbalist, won’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I believe he’s a regular at Café Classe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000620065006C0069006500760065002000680065201900730020006100200072006500670075006C00610072002000610074002000430061006600E900200043006C0061007300730065002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You should head to Café Classe. I believe the old\nherbalist’s a regular there.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, hello? What do you need?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002C002000680065006C006C006F003F0020005700680061007400200064006F00200079006F00750020006E006500650064003F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you the herbalist?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F00750020007400680065002000680065007200620061006C006900730074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s a sickly Pokémon...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650072006520190073002000610020007300690063006B006C007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, I see... A Fennekin that’s feeling poorly, hm?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C002000490020007300650065002E002E002E00200041002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00200074006800610074201900730020006600650065006C0069006E006700200070006F006F0072006C0079002C00200068006D003F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fennekin are known to eat twigs for an energizing\nand soothing snack.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00200061007200650020006B006E006F0077006E00200074006F002000650061007400200074007700690067007300200066006F007200200061006E00200065006E0065007200670069007A0069006E0067000A0061006E006400200073006F006F007400680069006E006700200073006E00610063006B002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I imagine a Revitalizing Twig in particular could\nperk your Fennekin right up.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But the area where I used to gather them is now a\npart of Wild Zone 5...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You can tell a Revitalizing Twig by its sweet scent.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThough it won’t be easy to find one while fending\noff attacks from wild Pokémon...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You may still be able to find Revitalizing Twigs in\nthe Bleu District’s Wild Zone 5.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou’ll know them by their sweet smell.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This twig seems shriveled... It doesn’t look like it\nwould revitalize anyone.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This twig has been gnawed on by something...\nNo one would be revitalized by this.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This twig is pretty broken and damaged... It\ndoesn’t seem like it would revitalize anyone.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This twig’s all dry and brittle... Probably not the\nsort of thing that would revitalize anyone.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This twig gives off a nice, sweet smell... You’ve\nfound the perfect Revitalizing Twig!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Time to head back to that sickly Fennekin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006D006500200074006F002000680065006100640020006200610063006B00200074006F002000740068006100740020007300690063006B006C0079002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
