      "offsetInSection": 3944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Revitalizing Twig...?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI had no idea such a thing existed! That herbalist\nis a true gem—and so are you for finding one!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s give it to Fennekin at once.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650074201900730020006700690076006500200069007400200074006F002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E0020006100740020006F006E00630065002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You fed the Revitalizing Twig to the wild Fennekin!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000660065006400200074006800650020005200650076006900740061006C0069007A0069006E00670020005400770069006700200074006F0020007400680065002000770069006C0064002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E002100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fen! Fen!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460065006E0021002000460065006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How delightful! It’s looking wonderfully energetic\nnow!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F0077002000640065006C006900670068007400660075006C0021002000490074201900730020006C006F006F006B0069006E006700200077006F006E00640065007200660075006C006C007900200065006E0065007200670065007400690063000A006E006F0077002100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kiiin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B006900690069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why, it seems like this Fennekin has taken a shine\nto you! Why not let it tag along?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
